-- Backend MVP completion (2026-11-04)
-- Line-item pricing, case messages, request assignment, contact enquiries,
-- job runs, shipment transition rules, a transactional email outbox fed by
-- database triggers, link-based quote responses and richer public tracking.
-- Idempotent: every statement can run twice (tested).

-- =============================================================================
-- 1. Types and tables (generated by `prisma migrate diff`, made idempotent)
-- =============================================================================
